# Forbidden: border-left as accent

**NEVER** use `border-left` (or `border-right`) as a visual accent or decoration on UI components.

## ❌ Avoid

```css
.element {
  border-left: 2px solid var(--color-1);
}

.card {
  border-left: 3px solid blue;
}
```

## ✅ Allowed alternatives

- Background with gradient
- Colored box-shadow
- Pseudo-elements (`::before`, `::after`)
- Border-radius with background
- Glow effects with `box-shadow`

```css
/* Subtle gradient */
.element {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(...), ...);
}

/* Colored shadow */
.element {
  box-shadow: -2px 0 0 0 var(--color-accent);
}

/* Pseudo-element */
.element::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  width: 3px;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--color-accent);
}
```
